Sītā sees Rāvaṇa flying away with her --- Sītā calls Rāvaṇa shameless cowardly thief --- Sītā says magic deer lured Rāma away --- Sītā says fallen protector lies struck down --- Sītā mocks Rāvaṇa boasted valor --- Sītā warns Rāma and Lakṣmaṇa will kill him --- Sītā sees death noose around his neck --- Sītā wails helplessly in Rāvaṇa's lap